# Copy to `.env` for local development. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# Leaving this empty is the supported state: the chat renders its not-configured line and nothing
# else in the app is affected. Deliberate, and argued in
# `docs/decisions/0010-the-coaches-stay-off.md` — which also holds the steps for switching it on.
#
# `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` is inlined into the bundle at build time, so the value must be present wherever
# the build runs, and a build that already happened will not pick up a value set afterwards.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=
